 .../RedundantFlagCalculationElimination.cpp   | 43 ++++++++++++++++++-
 .../IR/Passes/RegisterAllocationPass.cpp      | 24 +++++++++++
 2 files changed, 66 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

